# Dart formatting

Source of truth is `sprout_app/analysis_options.yaml` (`formatter.page_width: 80`, `trailing_commas: automate`). Cursor format-on-save uses the Dart SDK formatter with those options.

After creating or editing Dart files, from `sprout_app/` run:

```bash
dart format path/to/changed.dart
```

Do **not** hand-wrap lines, pick a different width, or pass `--line-length` / `--page-width` that disagrees with analysis_options. Cloud agents must format before handing back so a local save does not rewrite the file.
